="00:53.252" end="00:53.532">just </span><span begin="00:53.532" end="00:53.900">being </span><span begin="00:53.900" end="00:54.532">honest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.580" end="01:00.748"><span begin="00:57.580" end="00:57.764">And </span><span begin="00:57.764" end="00:57.940">I </span><span begin="00:57.940" end="00:58.108">know </span><span begin="00:58.108" end="00:58.324">my </span><span begin="00:58.324" end="00:58.972">lies </span><span begin="00:59.348" end="00:59.532">could </span><span begin="00:59.532" end="00:59.676">not </span><span begin="00:59.676" end="00:59.917">make </span><span begin="01:00.068" end="01:00.252">you </span><span begin="01:00.252" end="01:00.748">believe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.396" end="01:05.899"><span begin="01:02.396" end="01:02.573">We're </span><span begin="01:02.573" end="01:02.980">running </span><span begin="01:03.292" end="01:03.468">in </span><span begin="01:03.468" end="01:04.332">circles </span><span begin="01:04.507" end="01:04.716">that's </span><span begin="01:04.716" end="01:05.899">why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.365" end="01:12.164"><span begin="01:07.365" end="01:07.556">In </span><span begin="01:07.556" end="01:07.732">my </span><span begin="01:07.732" end="01:08.220">dark </span><span begin="01:08.372" end="01:08.684">times </span><span begin="01:09.660" end="01:09.860">I'll </span><span begin="01:09.860" end="01:10.052">be </span><span begin="01:10.052" end="01:10.364">going </span><span begin="01:10.524" end="01:10.868">back </span><span begin="01:10.868" end="01:11.228">to </span><span begin="01:11.228" end="01:11.460">the </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:12.164">street</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.252" end="01:17.324"><span begin="01:13.252" end="01:13.924">Promising </span><span begin="01:14.220" end="01:15.492">everything </span><span begin="01:15.756" end="01:16.044">I </span><span begin="01:16.044" end="01:16.492">do </span><span begin="01:1